        "description": "<p><strong>Faith is about what you do. It’s about aspiring to be better and nobler and kinder than you are.</strong></p><p><em>—Jim Butcher, Changes</em></p><p>Channelers of the magic of creation, luminaries are philosophers, muses, and healers.</p><h3>Iconic Luminaries</h3><ul><li><strong>Aerith Gainsborough</strong>, <em>Final Fantasy VII</em></li><li><strong>Goldmoon</strong>, <em>Dragonlance</em></li><li><strong>Nynaeve Sedai</strong>, <em>The Wheel of Time</em></li><li><strong>Ophilia Clement</strong>, <em>Octopath Traveler</em></li></ul><h3>Playing Luminary</h3><p>Luminary is a high-support healer. It’s recommended that you avoid direct melee.</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Cast<br /><strong>Move:</strong> Midline/Backline<br /><strong>Starting Pack:</strong> Devout<br /><strong>Key Stat:</strong> Awareness<br /><strong>Complexity:</strong> ★★★☆☆<br /><strong>Training:</strong> Influence, Mysticism</p><h3>Class Features</h3><table class=\"NormalTable\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Features</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Spells</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Mana</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cast Max</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1st</p></td><td><p>Theurgy, Radiant Healer</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>3</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2nd</p></td><td><p>Overheal</p></td><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>4</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3rd</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>12</p></td><td><p>5</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>4th</p></td><td><p>Ever-Cure (1 Status)</p></td><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>16</p></td><td><p>6</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>20</p></td><td><p>7</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6th</p></td><td><p>Revivify</p></td><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>24</p></td><td><p>8</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>28</p></td><td><p>9</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>8th</p></td><td><p>Ever-Cure (2 Statuses)</p></td><td><p>7</p></td><td><p>32</p></td><td><p>10</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9th</p></td><td><p>Perk</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>36</p></td><td><p>11</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10th</p></td><td><p>Life-Giver</p></td><td><p>8</p></td><td><p>40</p></td><td><p>12</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "isSpellcaster": true,
