            "level": 1,
            "name": "Theurgy",
            "description": "<p>You can Cast Spells using Mysticism.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 4 Spells, one of which must always be Life. You learn 1 other Spell every 2 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (4 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (2 + your Level).</p>",
